    {
      "id": "act-shut",
      "title": "The middle is already shut",
      "caption": "Nobody dives in. The inside passes are closed by where men stand.",
      "notes": "\"Pressing is not about running and it is not about working hard. It is about controlling space. Force the opposition to pass where you want them to.\" The nine shows the centre-back the touchline with the angle of his approach; the ten covers the switch behind him. Neither of them is trying to win the ball here.",
