    {
      "id": "act-trigger",
      "title": "The trigger is the pass to the full-back",
      "caption": "One pass. Eleven minds. The whole side leans before it arrives.",
      "notes": "The press was not started by a whistle or by a mistake. It was started by a specific pass — out to the full-back, the weakest passer on the pitch, in the narrowest part of it. The side moves on the pass, not on the reception.",
